  vendorName: Broker Byron
  offerText: Your parlor is filled with leaking oil drums. Pay my hazard fee, and
    my men will roll them out into the street to give you your home back.
  acceptResultText: Byron's men try to move the drums but spill thick, toxic sludge
    all over your floor. The stench is unbearable, and the drums are still stuck
    in your room.
  rejectResultText: You throw the scammers out. You carefully and slowly roll the
    drums outside yourself, getting a great workout and saving your money.
